earch\n---\nYes. AQI displays/reports always use the maximum daily AQI value in the geographic region represented. ... At this time, design values are not available from AirData. Design values can be obtained from AQS.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"dcd222a0666f4645\">>>", "published": "November 7, 2020", "siteName": "19january2021snapshot.epa.gov"}]}, "isError": false, "timestamp": 1775570513230}}
